<strong>Singe threaded</strong> - program will run the backtests sequentially, one task after another. This is slower, but consumes less memory.=<strong>Singe threaded</strong> - program will run the backtests sequentially, one task after another. This is slower, but consumes less memory.
<strong>Multi threaded</strong> - program runs multiple generations in parallel, each on its own processor core. It is faster, but it also consumes more memory and of course more processor power.=<strong>Multi threaded</strong> - program runs multiple generations in parallel, each on its own processor core. It is faster, but it also consumes more memory and of course more processor power.
If you check this option, the list of trades will be stored only in a temporary file that is created for every strategy.<br>This greatly saves computer memory and you can run evolution on much larger populations.<br>The disadvantage is that when you'd want to see the strategy equity chart or list of trades, it has to be loaded from the temporary file, which will be slower than from memory.=If you check this option, the list of trades will be stored only in a temporary file that is created for every strategy.<br>This greatly saves computer memory and you can run evolution on much larger populations.<br>The disadvantage is that when you'd want to see the strategy equity chart or list of trades, it has to be loaded from the temporary file, which will be slower than from memory.
Usually it is not necessary to keep track on expired and replaced orders, you should enable this option only if you need to check the list of complete trades.=Usually it is not necessary to keep track on expired and replaced orders, you should enable this option only if you need to check the list of complete trades.
<p>If checked, long and short rules will share the same parameter names.<br>If you uncheck it, you'll be able to use different parameters for each direction.</p>=<p>If checked, long and short rules will share the same parameter names.<br>If you uncheck it, you'll be able to use different parameters for each direction.</p>
<p>If checked, the strategy will contain parameters allowing you to control options like trading time ranges, check signals on bar open.</p>=<p>If checked, the strategy will contain parameters allowing you to control options like trading time ranges, check signals on bar open.</p>
Check parts of the strategy (entry, order type, exit) that should be regenerated.<br/>For every part you can select if the part should be completely replaced (<strong>replace</strong>) or if new condition should be added to the existing part (<strong>add</strong>).=Check parts of the strategy (entry, order type, exit) that should be regenerated.<br/>For every part you can select if the part should be completely replaced (<strong>replace</strong>) or if new condition should be added to the existing part (<strong>add</strong>).
